{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a tranquil journey where the rhythmic lapping of waves and the gentle tug on your line are your only companions. In this charming fishing game, you're free to explore a vibrant world brimming with secrets. Discover <strong>hidden coves</strong>, navigate <strong>winding rivers</strong>, and venture into the <strong>mysterious depths</strong> as you seek out new fishing grounds.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vast, explorable environments:</strong> Discover new fishing spots and hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wealth of gear:</strong> Find unique rods and a variety of baits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A diverse ecosystem:</strong> Catch a wide array of fish, common and rare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing gameplay:</strong> Unwind with intuitive controls and a calming atmosphere.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3784930?t=1769393786","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3784930?t=1769393786","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784930/7d63d87e33b235477d278924865bc0492b86aa33/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769393786","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784930/7d63d87e33b235477d278924865bc0492b86aa33/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769393786","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a tranquil journey where the rhythmic lapping of waves and the gentle tug on your line are your only companions. In this charming fishing game, you're free to explore a vibrant world brimming with secrets. Discover <strong>hidden coves</strong>, navigate <strong>winding rivers</strong>, and venture into the <strong>mysterious depths</strong> as you seek out new fishing grounds.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vast, explorable environments:</strong> Discover new fishing spots and hidden secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A wealth of gear:</strong> Find unique rods and a variety of baits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A diverse ecosystem:</strong> Catch a wide array of fish, common and rare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing gameplay:</strong> Unwind with intuitive controls and a calming atmosphere.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Storm Forest Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784930/fe984dca0f555a16a48cd7ee8ddf49ef295d0b1b/header.jpg?t=1769393786","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3784930/1638134716/af65b458e426ae4878fa256fbf85e89e72d90b4a/1769388634/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769389159","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3784930/1638134716/af65b458e426ae4878fa256fbf85e89e72d90b4a/1769388634/dash_h264.mpd?t=1769389159","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3784930/1638134716/af65b458e426ae4878fa256fbf85e89e72d90b4a/1769388634/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1769389159","id":257272689,"name":"Fish Tales and Cozy Trails Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st